"Maya, you tell a very good story," Neha says.
I smiled and I thanked Neha.
I said goodbye to Amit, Neha, and Sanjay.
"Good night friends," I said.
I go to the nearby bus stop.
In a short while, my BEST bus arrives.
I board the bus.
I give money to the conductor bhaiya.
I take my ticket and sit on a seat.
I get a window seat.
I look at Mumbai out the window.
I think about my story.
I came to Mumbai for the first time in January.
I took a taxi and went to my new home.
I saw my neighbour Asha for the first time.
The next day I went to the office.
I talked to Rohan and started my work.
Those early days were very busy.
Today I am very happy in this bus.
This city feels like my home to me now.
